ee bedrooms with three full bathrooms and bedrooms on both levelsso you can choose the home that complements your lifestyle. The Lake | 3 Bedrooms 2.5 Bathrooms Attached Two-Car Garage Enjoy the convenience of your own attached two-car garage and 1,5421,567 square feet of thoughtfully designed living space. An open-concept main level creates a welcoming setting for everyday living and entertaining, while all three bedrooms are upstairs. A versatile upstairs flex landing offers room for a home office, reading nook, or additional lounge, complemented by a dedicated laundry room. The Wilson | 3 Bedrooms 3 Full Bathrooms Discover a flexible layout with 1,4711,491 square feet, a downstairs bedroom and separate full bathroom, and two upstairs bedrooms, each with its own private ensuite bathroom. Offered without attached garages, these residences combine inviting shared living areas with the convenience and privacy of three full bathrooms. Thoughtful Details. Everyday Comfort. Every townhome features quartz countertops, premium LG appliances, a full-size LG washer and dryer, and a smart thermostat. Choose from interior and corner residences, with additional windows bringing more natural light into corner homes. Community amenities include a resort-style swimming pool and cabana, landscaped common areas, and illuminated walkways. Nearby shopping, dining, entertainment, and major roadways connect you to the best of Central Florida. Now pre-leasing. Explore the Lake and Wilson floor plans and schedule your tour today.","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":["Some options are future availability"],"min_rent":1861,"images":[{"url":"https://ar.rdcpix.com/72086c272211d8aa2f1197e2204cbc71c-f3600109212r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["house_view","road","yard","back_side","complete","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ar.rdcpix.com/72086c272211d8aa2f1197e2204cbc71c-f3600109212s.jpg